{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214070","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214070","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1321407001:1":{"text":"Excuse me, do you have anything hot to drink? Something that can warm up the body? It would be best if it could also help with hangovers.","source_cn":"不好意思，请问你们这里有没有能让身体暖和起来的热饮？最...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46A9A92DF120797D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321407002:1":{"text":"Oh, did someone get drunk and sleep in the snow again?","source_cn":"哟，又有人喝醉了睡在雪地里了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06F03D85F0CFE0D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321407003:1":{"text":"How did you know?","source_cn":"你……你怎么知道？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43D679277E17A6F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321407004:1":{"text":"Ha! I have the overnight shift. I'm used to seeing people doing dumb things like this.","source_cn":"哈哈，通宵赶工之后老有人干这种蠢事，我都习惯了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC43B20F1F3F3A4B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321407005:1":{"text":"There's some <style=\"highlight\">hot hangover brew</style> in my pack. It's hot and spicy and can even up the dead. You can find it in there.","source_cn":"喏，这个包里有<style=highlight>解酒的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE816D104EA970D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321407006:1":{"text":"By the way, can you help organize my pack after you're done? I still have a lot of work to do.","source_cn":"拿完之后，记得帮我把包整理好，我还得干活儿呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FC88987288409CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:乌里扬娜":{"text":"Uliana","source":"乌里扬娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小彼得":{"text":"Peter","source":"小彼得","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}